<h3><u>Maa ne asghar ko</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  'Comic Sans MS'; font-size: large; "">(Hai asghar hai hai asghar) x2</span><br></p><span class=""Apple-style-span""  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><font face=""Comic Sans MS"" size=""4""><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jo jhule me na paaya ho gha) x3</p><ol><li>Raat bhar chain use, kistarha aaya hoga</li><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jo jhule me na paaya ho gha) x2</p><li>Maa yehi sooch ke rooti thi lahu ke aansu, Sheh ne kistarha kiya hoga tere khoon se wuzoo, (Teer jab asghare) x2 beshir ne khaya hoga</li><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jo jhule me na paaya ho gha) x2</p><li>Raat bhar chain use kistarha aaya hoga</li><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jo jhule me na paaya ho gha) x2</p><li>Kuch jalee beeghriya jhule ki utha laayee thee, Baanu jab choot ke zindaan se ghar aayee the, (Haal asghar ka youn) x2 sughra ko sunaya hoga</li><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jo jhule me na paaya ho gha) x2</p><li>Raat bhar chain use kistarha aaya hoga</li><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jo jhule me na paaya ho gha) x2</p><li>Zindagi bhar kabhi saaye mein naa baithi madar, Kehti thi dhoop me sota hai mera noore nazar (Meri to kabr pe bhi) x2 dhoop ka saaya hoga</li><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jo jhule me na paaya ho gha) x2</p><li>Raat bhar chain use kistarha aaya hoga</li><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jho jhule me na paaya ho gha) x2</p><li>Poochti rehti thi har ek se maa ashgar ki, Mujhko batlao bani qabr kaha asghar ki (Uski turbat pe diya) x2 kisne jalaaya hoga</li><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jo jhule me na paaya ho gha) x2</p><li>Raat bhar chain use x2 kistarha aaya hoga</li></ol><p>(Maa ne ashgar ko jo jhule me na paaya ho gha) x2</p></font></span></p>
                 